                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1b2c69d4-2993-4c5f-89ea-a2995014acb7",
                                "sense_id": "4679c56d-94a4-3e91-a98b-8ab82beca905",
                                "text": "Just think. If you were some big shot like a casting director or something, I'd be staring into your bridgework, saying, 'Yes, Mr. Smearkase; no, Mr. Smearkase; not really, Mr. Smearkase. Oh! Mr. Smearkase, that's my knee!'"
